WEBVTT

00:03:29.063 --> 00:03:30.563
While with my team ...

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.263
I felt it slip out of me.

00:03:40.297 --> 00:03:41.830
I went to the bathroom ...

00:03:44.663 --> 00:03:45.997
and it fell to the floor.

00:03:50.197 --> 00:03:51.763
I didn't know what to do,

00:03:52.997 --> 00:03:57.297
so I just walked back out to the team,
pretending as if nothing happened.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:01.963
It took going through
infertility, miscarriage,